    "Id": "chassisdef_thug_THG-MRT",
    "Name": "Thug",
    "Details": "The custom variant piloted by ex–Com Guard and Broadsword Legion CO Kari Marita, the standard PPCs have been swapped for Clan ER PPCs, helping to free up weight for a C3i unit.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Energy</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.16</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_thug"
